 Godaa guntsay, «Hoola!» giissiyaawaa.","poem":2}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"Med'inaa Godaa guntsay zigatuwaa mentsereetsee;","poem":1},{"text":"Liibaanoosa giyaa biittan de'iyaa zigatuwaakka,","poem":2},{"text":"Med'inaa Goday mentsereetsee.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Liibaanoosa deretuwaa galo maraadan buraak'issee;","poem":1},{"text":"Siriyoona giyaa wolk'k'aama deriyaa Mentsaadan p'is's'illissee.","poem":2}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"Med'inaa Godaa kooshshay,","poem":1},{"text":"walk'k'antsaa wolk'k'amissee.","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"Med'inaa Godaa kooshshay bazzuwaa k'aatsee;","poem":1},{"text":"Med'inaa Goday K'aadeesa Bazzuwaa k'aatsee.","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"Med'inaa Godaa kooshshay wolatuwaa k'aatsee;","poem":1},{"text":"mitsaa haytsaakka k'ok'k'ofee.","poem":2},{"text":"Yaatina, I de'iyaa sa'aan de'iyaawanttu,","poem":1},{"text":"«Bonchchuu S'oossaw gido» yaagiino.","poem":2}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"text":"Med'inaa Goday di'uwaa haatsaa bolla bare kawutetsaa araataa wotsiide utteedda;","poem":1},{"text":"Med'inaa Goday bare kawutetsaa araatan uttiide,","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"med'inaw kaateteedda.","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"text":"Med'inaa Goday bare asaw wolk'k'aa immee.","poem":1},{"text":"Med'inaa Goday bare asaa sarotetsaan anjjee.","poem":2}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/dwr_ltw/PSA/29.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/dwr_ltw/PSA/30.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/dwr_ltw/PSA/28.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":11}